[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4141.669, "timestamp": "01:09:01", "text": "[音樂] 我要把最後一個給[音樂]。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4146.789, "timestamp": "01:09:06", "text": "哦，哇。  好的。是的。我們走吧。  好多清潔工作。  是啊，要打掃好多地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4166.309, "timestamp": "01:09:26", "text": "61. 是的，我想我們已經"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4172.63, "timestamp": "01:09:32", "text": "夠了。是的，我們現在可以買洗碗機了。音樂響起吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4177.749, "timestamp": "01:09:37", "text": "。再見，桑克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4179.95, "timestamp": "01:09:39", "text": "我要把你趕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4183.749, "timestamp": "01:09:43", "text": "出去。  等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4185.39, "timestamp": "01:09:45", "text": "，"}]